{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1201755-FinanceMinisterLanFuoansSpeechatAPECFinanceMinistersMeeting\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Finance Minister Lan Fuo'an's Speech at APEC Finance Ministers Meeting</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1201748-APEC%E8%B2%A1%E9%95%B7%E6%9C%83%E8%AD%B0%E8%B6%B3%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%8D%E6%BA%AB%E8%B2%A1%E6%94%BF%E9%83%A8%E9%83%A8%E9%95%B7%E8%97%8D%E4%BD%9B%E5%AE%89%E8%87%B4%E9%96%8B%E5%B9%95%E8%BE%AD\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">APEC財長會議‧足本重溫｜財政部部長藍佛安致開幕辭</a></p><p></p><p>亞太經濟合作組織APEC財長會，下午舉行正式會議。</p><p></p><p>東道主、中國財政部部長藍佛安主持會議。承辦會議的香港，財政司司長陳茂波、財庫局局長許正宇出席，美國財政部，以及俄羅斯財政部，均由副部長出席。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.APEC.PM-1600_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20262N6AN5UnqF1792488815.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>藍佛安致開幕辭時指，亞太是全球經濟增長引擎，各經濟體要強化經濟政策穩定性，並加快推進經濟轉型，促進共同繁榮。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:05.118852+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T09:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:01.725520+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:01.725520+00:00","content_hash":"3c99d94f2426a25cdeffcb7c25eb35d267281b8b38b82e8d72f381285e9d7e60","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}